{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into the chaos with the <i>Trouble In Cookie Town</i> Demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump straight into the action from the very beginning of the game. Explore the first three missions and get a taste of the sweet (and slightly unhinged) Cookie Town \u2014 with a third of the entire city unlocked and ready for mischief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get hands-on with all the core features of <strong><i>Trouble in Cookie Town</i></strong>, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude9d <strong>Grapple, Swing &amp; Soar!</strong> \u2013 Use your physics-based grappling hook to zip through Cookie Town, dodge monsters, and recover Broccoli!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556390/extras/GameplayGif4-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744300587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf6a <strong>Cookie-Chomping Chaos!</strong> \u2013 Face an army of unpredictable, dancing, and dangerously hungry monsters who won\u2019t stop until every crumb of Cookie Town is devoured!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556390/extras/GameplayGif3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744300587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Complete Wacky Challenges!</strong> \u2013 Take on bizarre physics-based puzzles and absurd objectives to recover all the missing Broccoli pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556390/extras/GameplayGif1-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1744300587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556390?t=1744300587","background_raw"